                    `PART ID: ${part.id}\n` +
                    `NAME: ${part.name}\n` +
                    `OUTER LENGTH: ${part.origLength}mm\n` +
                    `OUTER WIDTH: ${part.origWidth}mm\n` +
                    `NET CUT LENGTH: ${part.length}mm\n` +
                    `NET CUT WIDTH: ${part.width}mm\n` +
                    `QUANTITY: 1\n` +
